flowchart LR
  Goal[Authorized goal] --> N1[Lane A: inspect]
  Goal --> N2[Lane B: research]
  Goal --> N3[Lane C: risk review]
  N1 --> Merge[Integrator]
  N2 --> Merge
  N3 --> Merge
  Merge --> V[Verification]
